RANK REGULATION -- SAND GENIN HANDBOOK
Kazekage Office, rank division / Academy

For the newly confirmed genin of Sunagakure. This handbook sets the duties and
limits of your rank.

Your standing:
- You are a shinobi of the Sand, bearing the hourglass headband, but the most
  junior of the ranks. You serve under a jonin in a genin cell.
- You are cleared for D- and C-rank missions: escort, reconnaissance, labor, and
  caravan support. Higher ranks require chunin standing and jonin oversight.

Your duties:
- Obey your squad jonin and complete objectives with discipline.
- Honor the water ration policy above all; a genin who wastes water endangers
  the squad.
- Train your chakra nature, most often wind, and any specialization you show.
- Respect the Leaf alliance; treat allied shinobi as comrades.

Your path: Through the Chunin Exams and proven judgment you may rise to chunin.
Serve the village and the Kazekage well. Refer questions to your instructor.
Sealed to rank records.
